sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You
  participant W as Web app
  participant B as Brain
  participant G as Google

  U->>W: Settings → Connect Google
  W->>B: start connect
  B-->>U: open Google sign-in
  U->>G: sign in + tick all permissions
  G-->>B: authorisation code
  B->>G: exchange for a long-lived token
  B->>B: encrypt & store the token
  B->>G: create "SwarmAI — your email" sheet (6 tabs)
  B-->>W: ✅ connected (or what's missing)
